# T05 analysis of evidence/headline

**Filter reviews in SELL: 56** (55 traded; the last decision of the window, 2026-11-04, is a flagged SELL review that is not traded). Of the 56: 46 monthly only, 10 forced (a SELL spell's first decision), 4 of those also month-end. The flag is set on 101 of 411 weekly decisions (`review_mask_count` in audit.json: 101); 45 flagged decisions fall in BUY weeks and have no effect. T04 filtered at all 210 SELL decisions.
First reviews: 2019-01-02, 2019-01-25, 2019-02-22, 2019-05-10, 2019-05-31. Last reviews: 2026-03-27, 2026-09-11, 2026-09-25, 2026-10-30, 2026-11-04.

## Validity gates
| gate | what | result | detail |
|---|---|---|---|
| V1 | independent check verify_t05.py | PASS | 683,010 comparisons, 0 failures; corrupted copy detected: True; I5 SuperTrend branch: desk reading |
| V2 | point in time | PASS | 411 decisions, 0 labels after the decision; 410 trades, 0 not after their decision; 75,292 indicator stock-dates, 0 bars after the query date; 351 weekly-candle recomputations on bars up to the query date |
| V3 | null holds its table | PASS | 10,000 draws x 2 windows; 3,640,000 SELL decisions with k mismatches 0; 3,460,000 BUY events with mismatches 0; review flag mismatch 0 |
| V4 | always-in reproduces the published NAV | PASS | 2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-22: CAGR gap +0.045 pp/yr (limit 0.25); worst calendar year 2022 +0.426 pp (limit 0.5) |
| V5 | indicator reproducibility | PASS | 50 stock-date pairs vs a hand computation, 0 failed |

Cross-checks (not gates): regime series equals T04's headline decisions on 411 shared decision dates with 0 mismatches (411 decisions here, 411 in T04); the engine's review flag equals the calendar rule (T05.md 5a) on all but 0 of 411 decisions; regime series equals T03's on 400 shared dates with 0 mismatches; the full-switch comparator reproduces T03's SCMO_0003 strategy NAV (cost 0 / 20.8 / 50) to a maximum relative difference of 3.1e-15 up to 2026-08-07 (after that T03 accrued cash by a 90-session rate; this run reads the extended LBES).

## 4.0 The decision series
- Window 2019-01-02 -> 2026-11-04: 1,935 sessions, 411 weekly decisions (T0 plus the last session of each later ISO week), the last one not traded.
