## 4.0a The worked example (one SELL review, the weeks after it, one trade, one null draw)
**The review.** Decision j = 187, 2022-07-29 (the last session of its week), a review (monthly). Master SIGN rows: Nifty 100 BUY (2022-07-29), Midcap 100 BUY (2022-07-29), Smallcap 100 SELL (2022-07-29); not all three BUY, so the regime is SELL.
The basket in force (effective 2022-06-16) has n = 8 stocks. Indicator I1 (close > 50-day EMA) on their closes up to 2022-07-29:

| stock | basket weight | close | ema50 | EMA50 test: close > EMA50 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| SIYSIL.NS | 0.1250 | 528.56 | 519.70 | keep |
| GHCL.NS | 0.1250 | 604.68 | 581.26 | keep |
| VTL.NS | 0.1250 | 302.65 | 304.48 | drop |
| OIL.NS | 0.1250 | 126.67 | 141.91 | drop |
| HINDALCO.NS | 0.1250 | 415.05 | 384.45 | keep |
| NATIONALUM.NS | 0.1250 | 77.80 | 80.43 | drop |
| RKFORGE.NS | 0.1250 | 178.30 | 166.84 | keep |
| HGINFRA.NS | 0.1250 | 594.50 | 557.72 | keep |

k = 5 kept, with basket weights adding to 0.6250; the other 0.3750 of the book goes to the sleeve, half GOLDBEES and half LBES cash (0.1875 each).
**The trade** (next session, 2022-08-01, at each instrument's OHLC4): portfolio value before V = 1.794254; value traded = 2.242817; cost = traded x 20.8 / 2 / 10,000 = 0.002333; every target is then scaled by (V - cost) / V = 0.998700. Kept after the trade: SIYSIL.NS;GHCL.NS;HINDALCO.NS;RKFORGE.NS;HGINFRA.NS. NAV at that day's close 1.790574.
**The path.** I1 at 20.8 bps: NAV 1.0000 on 2019-01-02 -> 3.8245 on 2026-11-04; 1,935 sessions, years = (1,935 - 1) / 252 = 7.675; CAGR = 3.8245^(1/7.675) - 1 = 19.10%.
**One null draw** (I1, draw_id 0, seed `default_rng([5, 1, 0])`, u of shape (411, 197)): on the same review the draw keeps the k = 5 stocks of the 8 with the smallest u in row 187 (the review's own row, never the current week's): RKFORGE.NS, HINDALCO.NS, GHCL.NS, NATIONALUM.NS, SIYSIL.NS (the indicator kept SIYSIL.NS, GHCL.NS, HINDALCO.NS, RKFORGE.NS, HGINFRA.NS). It keeps those same stocks, those still in the basket, until the next review; everything else is as the strategy. That draw's after-cost CAGR is 20.59%.

